{"term":"黄片","lang":"zh","script":"hans","romanization":"huáng piàn","category":"sex_work_pornography","subcategory":"pornographic film","concept":"pornographic_film","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_neutral","crude":45,"technical":8,"recognition_pct_current":96,"recognition_pct_peak":96,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'yellow film'; the most widely used Mandarin slang term for pornographic video or film; 黄 (yellow) is the Chinese color-code for obscene/pornographic content.","english_term":"porn / dirty film","english_translation_quality":"direct","notes":"In Chinese cultural coding, 黄色 (yellow) = pornographic/obscene, analogous to English 'blue' for adult content; used universally across mainland China, Taiwan, and diaspora communities; the 黄 prefix applies broadly (黄书, 黄色笑话, etc.)."}
