{"term":"老鸨","lang":"zh","script":"hans","romanization":"lǎobǎo","category":"sex_work_pornography","subcategory":"brothel madam","concept":"brothel_manager","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"dated_slang","crude":45,"technical":15,"recognition_pct_current":83,"recognition_pct_peak":88,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'old bustard (bird)'; the traditional Chinese term for a brothel madam who manages female sex workers, collects earnings, and oversees the establishment.","english_term":"brothel madam / procuress","english_translation_quality":"direct","notes":"老 (old/experienced) + 鸨 (great bustard, a bird associated with licentiousness in classical texts due to folk beliefs about the species); the term appears in classical Chinese literature and opera (《金瓶梅》, etc.); still the default word for the concept despite brothels being illegal in the PRC."}
